If context_mode is "update" or "reuse", UPDATE the existing summary/hook rather than rewriting from scratch - preserve prior facts unless the new messages contradict them. If context_mode is "fresh", build the summary/hook from scratch.

Extract issues, write a summary, and draft a personalized re-engagement email. Return ONLY valid JSON: {"issues":["issue1"], "summary":"", "draft_email":"", "suggested_status":"Needs Review", "updated_context_summary":"", "updated_personalisation_hook":""}. CRITICAL: If you are uncertain about any extracted issue or lack confidence, you must set suggested_status to "needs_verification".

